{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/f2364242bd71fe418061dc32dbd2bd4e.avif?t=1769076988\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a decaying psychiatric hospital run by a manipulative psychiatrist, patients wander the halls with no memory of who they are or what was done to them. But you remember. You're not a patient. You're here to find your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguised as one of them, you must navigate a collapsing system of secrets, paranoia, and experimental treatments. Blend in. Stay undetected and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more your mind and your body begin to betray you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/99ef0bb9e5aa4194e4ebafbe6bc95918.avif?t=1769076988\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror RPG with a turn-based battle system where you fight with your emotions and thoughts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill check system based on mind &amp; body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your sanity decreases, you become more anxious, paranoid, or even psychotic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, oppressive atmosphere where paranoia, isolation and altered perception blur the line between reality and delusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission can be approached in multiple ways. Talk your way in, sneak around, or hack through locked systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter: dialogue, trust, access, and consequences change based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions can be failed, but the story adapts and continues. Creating a different path for every player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep deprivation, medication, therapy sessions and traumas affect what you see, hear, and say.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, collect evidences and uncover secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/b39d84f6275e1ea74e0bd00a90fb6c95.poster.avif?t=1769076988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/b39d84f6275e1ea74e0bd00a90fb6c95.webm?t=1769076988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/b39d84f6275e1ea74e0bd00a90fb6c95.mp4?t=1769076988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831970?t=1769076988","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831970?t=1769076988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/d569513f9140622de958a07369433810b68122db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769076988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/d569513f9140622de958a07369433810b68122db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769076988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence and gore. Depictions of blood, dismembered bodies, and disturbing imagery are present. The game also includes the following: Use of fictional psychiatric drugs, alcohol consumption, and mental health deterioration.\r\n\r\nThemes of depression, anxiety, child neglect, childhood trauma are represented in the game."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/f2364242bd71fe418061dc32dbd2bd4e.avif?t=1769076988\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a decaying psychiatric hospital run by a manipulative psychiatrist, patients wander the halls with no memory of who they are or what was done to them. But you remember. You're not a patient. You're here to find your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disguised as one of them, you must navigate a collapsing system of secrets, paranoia, and experimental treatments. Blend in. Stay undetected and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more your mind and your body begin to betray you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/99ef0bb9e5aa4194e4ebafbe6bc95918.avif?t=1769076988\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror RPG with a turn-based battle system where you fight with your emotions and thoughts</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill check system based on mind &amp; body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your sanity decreases, you become more anxious, paranoid, or even psychotic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, oppressive atmosphere where paranoia, isolation and altered perception blur the line between reality and delusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission can be approached in multiple ways. Talk your way in, sneak around, or hack through locked systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter: dialogue, trust, access, and consequences change based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions can be failed, but the story adapts and continues. Creating a different path for every player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep deprivation, medication, therapy sessions and traumas affect what you see, hear, and say.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, collect evidences and uncover secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/b39d84f6275e1ea74e0bd00a90fb6c95.poster.avif?t=1769076988\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/b39d84f6275e1ea74e0bd00a90fb6c95.webm?t=1769076988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/extras/b39d84f6275e1ea74e0bd00a90fb6c95.mp4?t=1769076988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Psychloom"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831970/a9b98f6925e520be1dbbd61b7db78af83a7fead2/header.jpg?t=1769076988","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3831970/2052754293/62b4f775b6b529016541f62c693eb68fe4add5a6/1769076053/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769076988","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3831970/2052754293/62b4f775b6b529016541f62c693eb68fe4add5a6/1769076053/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769076988","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3831970/2052754293/62b4f775b6b529016541f62c693eb68fe4add5a6/1769076