ghts in turn based battles. Talk, deceive, hack and survive. Stay quiet. Stay sane.","steam_appid":3831970,"support_info":{"email":"psychloomstudio@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Turkish","type":"game","website":null}